{"seq":2,"slug":"runnable-and-verifiable-projects","title":"可跑可验证的项目","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/build-and-tooling-for-agents/runnable-and-verifiable-projects","wordCount":1953,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"可跑可验证的项目\">可跑可验证的项目</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>agent 在一个项目里能做什么，首先取决于两件最低限度的事：能不能把项目<strong>跑起来</strong>，以及能不能<strong>验证</strong>自己的改动。跑不起来，它连第一步都迈不出去；验证不了，它只能凭推理盲改交付。两者齐备时，agent 才拥有一个闭合的自我纠错回路——改、验、据反馈再改。这不是抽象要求：SWE-bench 对 agent 的评判方式，就是在真实仓库里让它修改代码并检查仓库自身测试是否通过（arXiv:2310.06770），「可验证」直接构成了对 agent 能力的度量本身。本文拆解可跑与可验证各自支撑什么，给出验证栈的分层对照，并落到本仓库的具体配置上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>可跑是动手的前提。</strong> 「跑起来」的质量由步骤数量与步骤显式程度决定；还需要一条成功判据（预期端口、健康检查地址、探针命令），否则 agent 无法区分「起来了」和「看起来起来了」。</li>\n<li><strong>可验证是自我纠错的前提。</strong> 验证手段按成本与捕获的错误类别分层（lint / typecheck / test），聚合门把整个回路收敛成一条命令。</li>\n<li><strong>假信号是最隐蔽的敌人。</strong> 没有断言的假验证让 agent 把「绿」误读为「对」；flaky 用例的偶发假红会让它习得「红灯不必当真」，整个护栏随之失效。</li>\n<li><strong>退出码是 agent 的感官。</strong> 聚合命令必须把子步骤失败如实传导为非零退出码，绝不能因为打印了红色日志却返回 0 而让误判绿灯成为常态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可跑是动手的前提\">可跑是动手的前提</h2><p>「跑起来」的质量由两个变量决定：步骤数量与步骤显式程度。理想形态是本仓库这样的两步：<code>make install</code> 装依赖、<code>make dev</code> 起服务——命令少且名字自解释。</p>\n<p>确定性是常被忽视的另一半。Node 生态里 <code>npm ci</code> 的语义值得当作基准来理解：它只按 lockfile 精确安装整个项目、发现已有 node_modules 会先删除再装、且不能用来添加单个依赖（<a href=\"https://docs.npmjs.com/cli/v11/commands/npm-ci\">npm 官方文档</a>）。这意味着一条 <code>npm ci</code>（或 pnpm 侧保证 pnpm-lock.yaml 不被更新的 <code>--frozen-lockfile</code> 安装）就能把「装环境」从拼手气变成确定操作；而一个需要先全局装某工具、再手动 export 三个环境变量、再看 README 第 4 节的项目，每一步隐式知识都是 agent 的断点——人可能凭经验补上，agent 往往不会。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    W[Agent 修改代码] --&gt; V{有可运行的验证入口?}&#10;    V -- 有 --&gt; R[test / typecheck / lint]&#10;    R -- 全绿 --&gt; D[交付 commit]&#10;    R -- 失败 --&gt; F[读取失败输出定位原因] --&gt; W&#10;    V -- 没有 --&gt; Y[凭推理盲改&lt;br/&gt;错误后置到人或 CI] --&gt; Z[产出不可信]\">flowchart TD\n    W[Agent 修改代码] --&gt; V{有可运行的验证入口?}\n    V -- 有 --&gt; R[test / typecheck / lint]\n    R -- 全绿 --&gt; D[交付 commit]\n    R -- 失败 --&gt; F[读取失败输出定位原因] --&gt; W\n    V -- 没有 --&gt; Y[凭推理盲改&lt;br/&gt;错误后置到人或 CI] --&gt; Z[产出不可信]</pre><p>可跑还派生出运行时调试能力：能启动服务才能观察真实行为、复现 bug、做冒烟验证。一个只能静态阅读的项目，把 agent 降级成了「猜代码的模型」。这里有一个对文档的具体要求：跑起来的说明必须包含「成功长什么样」——预期监听的端口、健康检查地址、一条能确认服务活着的探针命令。没有成功判据的启动说明，agent 即使照做也无法区分「起来了」和「看起来起来了」，冒烟验证就无从谈起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可验证是自我纠错的前提\">可验证是自我纠错的前提</h2><p>验证手段的价值取决于它能捕获哪一类错误、以及跑一次的成本。下表按本仓库实际使用的工具分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证层</th>\n<th>工具（本仓库版本）</th>\n<th>捕获的错误类别</th>\n<th>单次量级成本</th>\n<th>对 agent 的意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>格式与 lint</td>\n<td>Biome ^2.4.9</td>\n<td>风格偏差、可疑模式；v2 起 type-aware 规则不依赖 tsc，速度足以逐轮全量跑</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>每轮编辑后立即可跑的第一道闸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td>TypeScript ~5.9.3</td>\n<td>接口不匹配、空值路径、契约漂移</td>\n<td>十秒级</td>\n<td>改动是否破坏结构的权威信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>Vitest ^4.1.2</td>\n<td>行为回归——唯一直接检验「逻辑对不对」的手段</td>\n<td>秒到分级</td>\n<td>自我纠错回路中最有力的反馈源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合门</td>\n<td><code>make check</code> = lint + typecheck + test</td>\n<td>以上全部</td>\n<td>三者之和</td>\n<td>一条命令闭合整个回路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>反模式有两类，都比没有测试更隐蔽。一是<strong>假验证</strong>：没有断言的冒烟测试、永远绿的占位用例，让 agent 把「绿」误读为「对」，错误被推迟到集成阶段才爆。二是<strong>慢验证</strong>：如果一轮验证要几十分钟，agent 在时间预算内的迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\le \\lfloor B/(t_{edit}+t_{verify}) \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 会跌到个位数，自我纠错名存实亡——这时它会理性地跳过验证交付，风险全部后置。</p>\n<p>还有一个统计学陷阱值得写进设计意识里。设各检查项相互独立、各自的偶发失败率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则一次全绿的通过率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{green} = \\prod_{i=1}^{k}(1-f_i) \\approx e^{-\\sum f_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>五道闸各 2% 偶发率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.98</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>90.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.98^5 \\approx 90.4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90.4%</span></span></span></span></span>——意味着约十分之一完全正确的改动也会吃到假红。反复经历假红的 agent 会习得「红灯不必当真」，整个护栏随之失效。所以 flaky 用例不是噪音，是对 agent 反馈系统的定向腐蚀，必须隔离修复而非重试掩盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"让项目可跑可验证\">让项目可跑可验证</h2><p>落点有三处。其一，验证入口必须是 agent 能调用的稳定命令：统一命名（<code>test</code>、<code>typecheck</code>、<code>lint</code>、<code>check</code>）比功能更重要，因为 agent 是靠名字建立预期的；藏在一个只在本地生效的别名里的验证等于不存在。其二，安装与验证都要走确定性路径——lockfile 加冻结安装保证每次拿到的依赖一致，验证结果才有跨环境的可比性。其三，把「怎么跑、怎么验」写进 AGENTS.md 或 README：这是给 agent 的接口文档，缺了它，前两条做得再好也要靠猜。</p>\n<p>权衡在于覆盖与速度的张力：类型检查和全量测试最有力但最慢，lint 最快但最浅。务实的排布是把快的放进步骤间循环、慢的放在任务收尾一次性跑，而不是让每一轮都付全款。聚合命令内部也应按成本升序排列并短路执行——lint 秒级先行、类型次之、测试最后——任何一道失败立即退出非零，让最便宜的检查拦下最多的问题。退出码是 agent 的「感官」：聚合命令必须把子步骤的失败如实传导为非零退出码，绝不能因为打印了红色日志却返回 0 而让误判绿灯成为常态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>在 package.json 固化标准脚本名，并用聚合目标串成单命令质量门（本仓库 <code>make check</code>），AGENTS.md 里只引用这一条。</li>\n<li>给测试套件设定墙钟预算并监控趋势，超限先并行化或拆分，而不是接受变慢。</li>\n<li>发现 flaky 用例立即移出主验证路径单独跟踪；记录它的历史失败率，作为判断修复优先级的依据。</li>\n<li>冷启动演练：删掉 node_modules 与缓存后，仅凭仓库内文档完成安装到验证的全流程，卡住的步骤就是文档债。</li>\n<li>为 CI 与本地提供同一条验证命令，避免「本地跳过、CI 才跑」造成的反馈延迟与结果分歧。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>可跑给了 agent 动手的资格，可验证给了它知道自己改没改对的手段，二者共同闭合自我纠错回路。验证的可信度会被假测试与 flaky 双向腐蚀，需要像维护代码一样维护它们。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../scripts-and-commands/one-command-to-run-and-test\">一键跑起与验证</a>——把可跑可验证落到单条命令的做法。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../fast-feedback-from-the-toolchain/clear-errors-and-output\">清晰错误与输出</a>——验证输出如何变成可用信号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可跑可验证的项目","id":"可跑可验证的项目"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可跑是动手的前提","id":"可跑是动手的前提"},{"level":2,"text":"可验证是自我纠错的前提","id":"可验证是自我纠错的前提"},{"level":2,"text":"让项目可跑可验证","id":"让项目可跑可验证"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"工具链是 Agent 的工作环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/build-and-tooling-for-agents/tooling-as-the-agents-environment"},"next":{"title":"可复现的环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/build-and-tooling-for-agents/reproducible-environments"}}